    "published_at": "2026-11-04T19:37:09Z",
    "body": "## What's new\n\n- Delete history sessions with Delete / Backspace in `/session`. Confirm before permanently removing a session and its messages; saved API keys and model settings are kept.\n- Deleted sessions are also removed from open tabs and the saved tab layout.\n- A new public website with installation commands, screenshots, animations, and release history.\n- The TUI version indicator now shows v1.0.3.\n\nNative builds: macOS Apple Silicon, macOS Intel, and Windows x64. Python is bundled.\n\n## 更新内容\n\n- 在 `/session` 中按 Delete / Backspace 删除历史会话，确认后清除该会话及聊天记录；保留 API Key 和模型配置。\n- 同步清理已删除会话的标签页及保存的标签页布局。\n- 上线全新官网，提供安装方式、界面展示、动画和历史版本。\n- TUI 右下角版本号更新为 v1.0.3。\n\n官网：https://01ny-yzx.github.io/horizon-harness/\n\n### Update / 更新\n\n```sh\nnpm install -g horizon-harness@1.0.3\n```\n\n```sh\nbrew update && brew upgrade 01ny-yzx/tap/horizon\n```\n\nClose Horizon before updating on Windows.\nWindows 用户请先退出 Horizon，再执行更新。\n",
